  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3303.02 Emissions Limits for Small MWC Units",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3303.02 Emissions Limits for Small MWC Units.\n\n(a) The emission limits for carbon monoxide for small MWC units shall be as specified in Table 5 of subpart BBBB in 40 CFR 60.\n\n(b) The emissions limits for small MWC units shall be as specified in 40 CFR 60, Table 4 of subpart BBBB, RSA 125-M:3, and RSA 125-C:10-a, as summarized in Appendix E for the air pollutants or parameters listed.\n\nSource. #7704, eff 6-7-02; ss by #9084, eff 2-2-08; ss by #11131, eff 7-18-16; ss by #12628, eff 9-27-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3300.html"
